================ Replica demo: primary (5432) + streaming replica (5433) ================

### 1. Who is who
PRIMARY port 5432  in_recovery=false
REPLICA port 5433  in_recovery=true

### 2. Write on the REPLICA must be rejected
ERROR:  cannot execute INSERT in a read-only transaction
-> rejected as expected (replica is read-only)

### 3. Insert on the PRIMARY
 student_id |          email           
------------+--------------------------
       1514 | demo.replica@example.com
(1 row)

INSERT 0 1

### 4. Read the same row on the REPLICA
 student_id | first_name  | last_name |          email           
------------+-------------+-----------+--------------------------
       1514 | DemoReplica | Streaming | demo.replica@example.com
(1 row)


### 5. Replication state, seen from the PRIMARY
 application_name |   state   | sync_state | sent_lsn  | replay_lsn | lag_bytes 
------------------+-----------+------------+-----------+------------+-----------
 walreceiver      | streaming | async      | 0/8004218 | 0/8004218  |         0
(1 row)


### 6. Replay position, seen from the REPLICA
 replayed_up_to | in_recovery 
----------------+-------------
 0/8004218      | t
(1 row)


================ End of replica demo ================
